  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Connects an RI, national node or grant to its funding source at any level. Transitivity lets the reasoner infer the full chain: RI → Grant → FundingProgramme. The property chain hasNode o isSupportedBy additionally rolls a distributed RI's node funding up to the RI, so the funders of the nodes are inferred funders of the RI itself."
  } ],
